        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "fill-amber",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "props": {
              "amber": {
                "filled": 1
              }
            },
            "pour": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "set-down-teapot",
          "duration": 1400,
          "effects": {
            "props": {
              "pot": {
                "x": 697,
                "y": 457,
                "tilt": 0,
                "owner": "table"
              }
            },
            "pour": 0
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-12",
          "text": "He lifted the little teapot and filled the amber cup. This time, Mara watched the tea find its level.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-13",
          "text": "You could have knocked.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "mara"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-14",
          "text": "I could. But there’s something I still need to ask.",
          "pauseMs": 3400,
          "who": "ellis"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 70.7
    },
    {
      "id": "tomorrow",
      "name": "A place for tomorrow",
      "targetSeconds": 70,
      "atmosphere": {
        "water": 0.028,
        "wind": 0.016,
        "birds": 0.002,
        "village": 0,
        "music": 0
      },
      "media": {
        "type": "animation"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "settle-in",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "chapter": 2,
            "view": "conversation"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-15",
          "text": "Then ask. The tea will keep.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "mara"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-16",
          "text": "Would you mind if I came back tomorrow? I don’t know many people here yet.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "ellis"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "turn-the-handle",
          "duration": 1100,
          "effects": {
            "view": "cups",
            "props": {
              "blue": {
                "handleLeft": 0
              }
            },
            "actors": {
              "mara": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "slide-the-invitation",
          "duration": 1700,
          "effects": {
            "props": {
              "blue": {
                "x": 719,
                "y": 516
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-17",
          "text": "Mara turned the blue cup’s handle toward him, then slid it across the table. A small invitation, made of porcelain.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-18",
          "text": "Tomorrow, you can knock. You don’t need to wait for a sign.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "mara"
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "ellis-takes-blue",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "props": {
              "blue": {
                "x": 786,
                "y": 506,
                "owner": "ellis"
              }
            },
            "actors": {
              "ellis": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "action",
          "id": "mara-takes-amber",
          "duration": 1800,
          "effects": {
            "props": {
              "amber": {
                "x": 636,
                "y": 505,
                "owner": "mara"
              }
            },
            "actors": {
              "mara": {
                "pose": "reach"
              }
            },
            "view": "together"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-19",
          "text": "Ellis took the blue cup. Mara picked up the amber one. They stood together while the last light warmed the terrace.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-20",
          "text": "I can bring biscuits.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "ellis"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-21",
          "text": "Good. I never know how many to make for one.",
          "pauseMs": 1800,
          "who": "mara"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "cup-22",
          "text": "For the first time in weeks, the second cup was not a habit. It was a place for someone.",
          "pauseMs": 4200,
          "kind": "narration"
        },
        {
          "type": "end",
          "id": "cup-end"
        }
      ],
      "estimatedSeconds": 72.1
    }
